SMART SCHOOL ERP SYSTEM
=======================

STATUS: ✅ RUNNING

SERVERS:
- Backend:  http://localhost:8000 (Django REST API)
- Frontend: http://localhost:3001 (React App)
- Admin:    http://localhost:8000/admin

LOGIN:
- Email:    admin@school.com
- Password: admin123

FEATURES:
✅ Authentication & JWT
✅ Students Management (Full CRUD)
✅ Staff Management
✅ Attendance Tracking
✅ Fee Management
✅ Results Management
✅ Dashboard with Charts

TECH STACK:
- Backend:  Django 4.2.7 + DRF + SQLite
- Frontend: React.js + React Router + Recharts

TO RUN:
./run.sh

OR MANUALLY:
Backend:  cd backend && source venv/bin/activate && python manage.py runserver
Frontend: cd frontend && PORT=3001 npm start
